{"about_the_game":"<strong>Demo:<br>The company's operating time limit is one year<br><br>Official version:<br>The company's operating time limit is unlimited</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/1y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/1.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong>Be a qualified boss, recruit talents with the <i>most reasonable</i> salary in the interview game, and build a company startup team! </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/2y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/2.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong>Employees will also have some needs or ideas when working, so pay attention to keeping them in a good mood! </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/3y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/3.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong>Every employee has a desire to improve. Train your employees and cultivate their attributes. </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/4y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/4.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong>Websites cannot be without server equipment! Buy computer rooms in different cities and regions, and make them run while being careful not to overheat them!<br>Of course, all of this requires you to do it yourself. </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/5y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/5.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br>Don\u2019t generate electricity for love! When the website has enough users, it means that many people will enter every day. Don\u2019t waste this traffic. Configure advertising contracts to get a considerable income. Of course, the more ads, the better, but too many ads will also affect users\u2019 satisfaction with the website. How to maintain a balance is a science. </strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748030?t=1749186159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748030?t=1749186159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/5deee1bdaa192c5aec2164a2b164bca4bee0c81c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749186159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/5deee1bdaa192c5aec2164a2b164bca4bee0c81c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749186159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Demo:<br>The company's operating time limit is one year<br><br>Official version:<br>The company's operating time limit is unlimited</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/1y.png?t=1749186159\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/1.gif?t=1749186159\" /><br><strong>Be a qualified boss, recruit talents with the <i>most reasonable</i> salary in the interview game, and build a company startup team! </strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748030/extras/2y.pn